/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 01-15-2020, 02:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-15T10:58:09-08:00","id":1361109,"title":"","content":"While I'm not entirely sure the thread title is appropriate, I'm entirely sure Cthulhu breaking reality just to serenade a Solar is as Exalted as it gets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-15T11:18:35-08:00","id":1361110,"title":"","content":"I'm sorry, all I can think of when I read that title was &quot;I didn't know Chuck Tingle was an Exalted fan.&quot;<br /> <br /> Which is...rather plausible, really.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-15T11:32:02-08:00","id":1361119,"title":"","content":"I can see humans having some kind of universal sex appeal. I can also see humans being the least sexy creatures out there but RLSS overcoming this.<br /> <br /> In line with my personal, political biases, I think attraction is probably more a thing between two (well one or more) individuals. I'm not exactly comfortable with entire species finding entire other species attractive.<br /> <br /> But if we look at the evidence the Elemental Censor of the West is a freakin' dragon with a mortal paramore. There's a strong implication that humans are just sexy.<br /> <br /> Tangent: I'm pretty sure RLSS makes you attractive by you changing how you present, not changing what other people find attractive. Like, a male Solar attracting a straight guy is doing it by being androgynous enough that the other dude doesn't feel gay. Scott Bakula style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 01-15-2020, 02:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-15T12:58:15-08:00","id":1361146,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epitome</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1361102-don-t-f-k-the-gay-f-k-cthulhu?p=1361109#post1361109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While I'm not entirely sure the thread title is appropriate, I'm entirely sure Cthulhu breaking reality just to serenade a Solar is as Exalted as it gets.</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Pounded By Flying Polyps After Cultists Erased My Elder Sign</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-15T13:53:03-08:00","id":1361152,"title":"","content":"I'd assume Raksha would be just as DTF with a Dragon King or whatever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-15T13:53:57-08:00","id":1361153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1361102-don-t-f-k-the-gay-f-k-cthulhu?p=1361119#post1361119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can see humans having some kind of universal sex appeal. I can also see humans being the least sexy creatures out there but RLSS overcoming this.<br /> <br /> In line with my personal, political biases, I think attraction is probably more a thing between two (well one or more) individuals. I'm not exactly comfortable with entire species finding entire other species attractive.<br /> <br /> But if we look at the evidence the Elemental Censor of the West is a freakin' dragon with a mortal paramore. There's a strong implication that humans are just sexy.<br /> <br /> Tangent: I'm pretty sure RLSS makes you attractive by you changing how you present, not changing what other people find attractive. Like, a male Solar attracting a straight guy is doing it by being androgynous enough that the other dude doesn't feel gay. Scott Bakula style.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's more that sexy is just objective in Creation. Personally, I blame Venus. Not necessarily sexual <i>attraction</i> being objective, but universal agreement that Fakharu is a mighty fine piece of scale even if you don't swing all the way out that far. The way people in real life will talk about attractive celebrities. <br /> <br /> Tangent: I always envisioned RLSS as being similar to Knowing the Soul's Price. There's <i>something</i> that will get the other party to engage in the desired behavior, but it's not necessarily lust. So the Solar unconsciously frames their seductive attempt in a manner relevant to to an appropriately strong Intimacy, even one they don't know about or that's not lust-adjacent, because they're just <i>that good</i>. The seduction can't be unacceptable due to lack of relevant intimacy because the target has <i>some</i> Intimacy strong enough, and it can't be unacceptable due to orientation because such a target would be approached along a non-sex vector.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25764-vwllss-trnt-prncss","name":"vwllss trnt prncss","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"244"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-15T15:56:38-08:00","id":1361174,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epitome</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1361102-don-t-f-k-the-gay-f-k-cthulhu?p=1361109#post1361109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While I'm not entirely sure the thread title is appropriate, I'm entirely sure Cthulhu breaking reality just to serenade a Solar is as Exalted as it gets.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is posts like this that remind me why I fell in love with Exalted for the first time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4428,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","user":"Daredevil","date":". 01-15-2020, 07:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-15T21:41:04-08:00","id":1361213,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1361102-don-t-f-k-the-gay-f-k-cthulhu?p=1361119#post1361119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tangent: I'm pretty sure RLSS makes you attractive by you changing how you present, not changing what other people find attractive. Like, a male Solar attracting a straight guy is doing it by being androgynous enough that the other dude doesn't feel gay. Scott Bakula style.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure how you get that read from this short charm fluff. You perk up your thick pecs and steel abs then supercharge it with sun daddy essence.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> With a provocative word and gesture, the Exalt amplifies her form with Essence, treating the target of such intensity to the fullness of her desires. </div> </div> </div>And besides, I want to be so hot that Cthulhu will have a boner, not some kind of phenomenon wrangler or psychic illusionist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-15T23:01:36-08:00","id":1361217,"title":"","content":"Does Cthulhu actually have sexual characteristics? A sufficiently skilled Solar with RLSS should potentially be able to seduce anything that's capable of sex and lust, but I'm not sure Cthulhu <i>is</i>.<br /> <br /> But then, Cthulhu is frankly a lot more alien than anything that actually exists in the world of Exalted. A Solar can certainly seduce titans, unshaped raksha, behemoths, those weird underground things that the Mountain Folk fight...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11237-jefepato","name":"Jefepato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-16T00:32:45-08:00","id":1361225,"title":"","content":"Given 3e Solar Charms, and Social Charms in general, are supposed to be more about Solars doing specific things than imposing essence on others to alter their mind or being, and given that Performance is about acting, all this seems to point to alteration and changes in presentation of the self than simply supercharging the self (more like JohnDoe's interpretation?).<br /> <br /> That said, I'm not sure if (or not) it really matters unless you're altering someone's player character or an NPC they *own* and feel strongly about, so maybe you can do this either way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-16T07:02:49-08:00","id":1361267,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jefepato</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1361102-don-t-f-k-the-gay-f-k-cthulhu?p=1361217#post1361217\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does Cthulhu actually have sexual characteristics? A sufficiently skilled Solar with RLSS should potentially be able to seduce anything that's capable of sex and lust, but I'm not sure Cthulhu <i>is</i>.<br /> <br /> But then, Cthulhu is frankly a lot more alien than anything that actually exists in the world of Exalted. A Solar can certainly seduce titans, unshaped raksha, behemoths, those weird underground things that the Mountain Folk fight...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> He has 3-4 children, so yes he does. He's a prehuman high priest of Yozi-level reality defining entities, and Exalted's got it's own &quot;Giant monsters who build cities to big&quot; (Obsidian in the Lunars suggests as much anyway).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-16T09:35:47-08:00","id":1361288,"title":"","content":"Speaking only internally to Exalted, the humanoid form appears to be some sort of metaphysical baseline at least within the domain of Primordial activity. Many of the Titans, and most of their souls have humaniform bodies, most of which will predate humanity and certainly wouldn't have been done to flatter or be familiar to humans. Raksha who take shape default to a fairly human form. The mountain folk and the lintha all were very human-looking and predate humanity as well.<br /> <br /> It came up back in 2E that Agata have really high appearance and people wondered if they were sexy giant wasps. I believe the general consensus is that while they are universally appealing, that appeal is not universally sexual (though will be for some people, even non-giant insects).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-16T11:25:38-08:00","id":1361308,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jefepato</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1361102-don-t-f-k-the-gay-f-k-cthulhu?p=1361217#post1361217\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does Cthulhu actually have sexual characteristics? A sufficiently skilled Solar with RLSS should potentially be able to seduce anything that's capable of sex and lust, but I'm not sure Cthulhu <i>is</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even if he weren\u2019t that would still be represented mechanically as \u201cThis kind of influence is unacceptable.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-16T21:44:53-08:00","id":1361390,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ghosthead</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1361102-don-t-f-k-the-gay-f-k-cthulhu?p=1361225#post1361225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given 3e Solar Charms, and Social Charms in general, are supposed to be more about Solars doing specific things than imposing essence on others to alter their mind or being, and given that Performance is about acting, all this seems to point to alteration and changes in presentation of the self than simply supercharging the self (more like JohnDoe's interpretation?).</div> </div> </div> </div>You don't shoot a solar mind beam at Cthulhu, you instead takes off your shirt and spreads shiny oil all over that thick hairy chest at the giant squid man. If that's mind-controlling then I'm my husband's mind slave according to this logic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-16T23:29:29-08:00","id":1361395,"title":"","content":"I mean, unless it runs into the Red Rule, the language of the charm implies that you would be able to seduce basically anything sentient, Automatons, long dead primordials, etc.<br /> <br /> Edit: \u201cTeach me about this human emotion called \u2018love\u2019.\u201d <br /> <br /> Lol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8959,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","user":"prototype00","date":". 01-17-2020, 03:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-17T00:33:45-08:00","id":1361403,"title":"","content":"@Jen, sure, but he has to be operating off something that's already &quot;in&quot; Cthulu*, or it seems not 3e &quot;Skillful performance where the performer changes behaviour to play on beliefs and ideas already in target, intensifying them introducing new ones&quot; but &quot;Mind control overwrites your mind to have different beliefs, ideas, likes, etc. with no logical method which is based on 'deeds of legend'.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> *Of course for practical purposes, it's your Cthulu, or your ST's, not HP's so you're pretty free to declare that whatever you want is somewhere in its mind to play on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-17T00:44:04-08:00","id":1361405,"title":"","content":"If the ability to be attracted to human is already \u201cin\u201d him then this charm is just straight-up useless.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-17T00:52:14-08:00","id":1361406,"title":"","content":"@Jen, seems like it still has some uses?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8959_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8959\" data-vbnamecard=\"8959\">prototype00</a>, though even if so, seems like that would not necessarily override their other behavioural capability and drives that much. If Flying Fox, Eclipse Caste, successfully seduces a barely sentiment shambling mass of corpses sent in his general direction by his Abyssal rival, it most likely still eats his braaains, but feels somewhat more, er... aroused while doing so (to the extent such a thing is possible for a shambling mass of corpses not assembled to such a purpose. It probably does not plan a dinner reservation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-17T00:54:42-08:00","id":1361407,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ghosthead</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1361102-don-t-f-k-the-gay-f-k-cthulhu?p=1361403#post1361403\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">@Jen, sure, but he has to be operating off something that's already &amp;quot;in&amp;quot; Cthulu*, or it seems not 3e &amp;quot;Skillful performance where the performer changes behaviour to play on beliefs and ideas already in target, intensifying them introducing new ones&amp;quot; but &amp;quot;Mind control overwrites your mind to have different beliefs, ideas, likes, etc. with no logical method which is based on 'deeds of legend'.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> *Of course for practical purposes, it's your Cthulu, or your ST's, not HP's so you're pretty free to declare that whatever you want is somewhere in its mind to play on.</div> </div> </div> </div>But that wording is not in the charm? I mean, there is nothing about needing to have any existing beliefs or ideas already in the target?<br /> <br /> I know some people have 2e badfeels about the social system, and how it was akin to mind control, but this is a high Essence Solar charm and thus I believe if it says:<br /> <br /> \u201cThis Charm supplements a persuade action to seduce a target, granting double 9s. The Solar may even seduce a character for whom such influence is unacceptable.\u201d<br /> <br /> Then it does what it says on the tin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-17T01:00:00-08:00","id":1361411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ghosthead</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1361102-don-t-f-k-the-gay-f-k-cthulhu?p=1361406#post1361406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">@Jen, seems like it still has some uses?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8959_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8959\" data-vbnamecard=\"8959\">prototype00</a>, though even if so, seems like that would not necessarily override their other behavioural capability and drives that much. If Flying Fox, Eclipse Caste, successfully seduces a barely sentiment shambling mass of corpses sent in his general direction by his Abyssal rival, it most likely still eats his braaains, but feels somewhat more, er... aroused while doing so (to the extent such a thing is possible for a shambling mass of corpses not assembled to such a purpose. It probably does not plan a dinner reservation.</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019d argue that if you successfully seduce a corpse monster, then it would possibly have an intensity of feeling for you akin to that it would have for it\u2019s Abyssal Master? No?<br /> <br /> And if it wasn\u2019t eating the brains of the 20 syllable edgelord a-hole who sent it against you, it probably is smart enough to extend the same courtesy to the Eclipse.<br /> <br /> Edit: Also come the gently caress on here, you\u2019re telling me that seducing the monster and turning it against the very dark lord that unleashed it doesn\u2019t have mythic resonance?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-17T01:02:08-08:00","id":1361413,"title":"","content":"Sure, in terms of outcomes, but the problem is it doesn't say on the tin how it* does it (does it work like Performance should, by crafting a Performance that plays on the targets mind, or without some logical method?). Since it's undefined I guess you can go with whatever, but something closer to JohnDoe's interpretation to me seems to be more in the spirit of Performance and of 3e Charms.<br /> <br /> *It as in &quot;actions by your character&quot; not, &quot;Some Charm that acts without reference to anything, directly&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-17T01:10:37-08:00","id":1361414,"title":"","content":"I don\u2019t know that \u201chow the charm works\u201d has ever been an important consideration in Exalted, given that the answer to all the bullshit Exalts can get up to is basically the same: Solar/Lunar/Sidereal Magic.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s like questioning what gives Lunars the right to turn into T-Rexes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8959,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","user":"prototype00","date":". 01-17-2020, 04:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-17T01:11:02-08:00","id":1361415,"title":"","content":"Again, I\u2019m not terribly interested in weaving some kind of illusions or emitting perception-altering pheromones that make me look like a squid girl (how is that even Solar???), what I want is a hot dad flexing and make Cthulhu feels all kinds of emotions in his tentacles for the dad.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-17T01:17:16-08:00","id":1361416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1361102-don-t-f-k-the-gay-f-k-cthulhu?p=1361415#post1361415\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Again, I\u2019m not terribly interested in weaving some kind of illusions or emitting perception-altering pheromones that make me look like a squid girl (how is that even Solar???), what I want is a hot dad flexing and make Cthulhu feels all kinds of emotions in his tentacles for the dad.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you want to do that feel free. However you fluff it (and lets not kid ourselves here, all this discussion about performance and whatnot is fluff) the rules that determine what exactly happen when you use this charm are extremely clear.<br /> <br /> Edit: Also, folks that say flexing isn\u2019t a performance action obviously haven\u2019t been to a bodybuilder competition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8959,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","user":"prototype00","date":". 01-17-2020, 04:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-17T15:34:16-08:00","id":1361589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>prototype00</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1361102-don-t-f-k-the-gay-f-k-cthulhu?p=1361395#post1361395\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">basically anything sentient</div> </div> </div> </div>It doesn\u2019t have that limitation either actually... O_o","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-17T17:15:05-08:00","id":1361610,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container