<strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1361102-don-t-f-k-the-gay-f-k-cthulhu?p=1361844#post1361844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...Look, it\u2019s not my fault the alleged difference between \u201csentience\u201d and \u201csapience\u201d changes every time someone insists there is one. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It does? Isn't sentience the ability to discern and sapience the ability to know?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800080\">I express my opinions, but YSMV; Your Stories May Vary.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><i>Formerly known as wyrmpuff</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12288-mal-akh","name":"Mal'akh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12288_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-22T02:41:41-08:00","id":1362603,"title":"","content":"I generally assume that the Charm works by way of being compelling and intriguing enough to arouse at least the curiosity of your prospective partner, regardless of incompatible sexuality or just plain not otherwise being into you at all.<br /> <br /> With enough allowances for the idea that no form of seduction will work on certain people or beings that can be described as having no sexual feelings whatsoever to try and effectively accommodate asexual people who would find the idea of depicting anything at all provoking sexual activities from people such as them too intrusive. That's Orichalcum Rule, not Red Rule.<br /> <br /> As for humans, I have three outlooks on the subject. One is that there are simply going to be an abundance of relationships crossed with humans simply by virtue of them being numerous and predominant (mind, Kimbery cross-bred to create the Lintha back when they were insignificant), and plenty of entities whose motives in such relationships are something other than or in addition to attraction and gratification. <br /> <br /> The other is to think that there might be some characteristics to human beings that do manage to have a wide appeal. Some of that is physical, not merely in attractive features but in perhaps the human body having qualities and capabilities that manage to be very useful for sex play across a variety of axes in a manner that a lot of other life forms don't (a lot of flexibility and interesting erogenous zones). I'd say some of that might arise from elements that aren't as tactile or comprehensible to other humans, but happen to be very compelling to the right beings, whether alien aesthetic qualifications or getting a kind of Taoist energy exchange thing out of sex that humans just happen to be well-suited for. I'd think some of it is less benign, where a lot of these spirits and other entities aren't quite seeking relationships for intimate or even physical gratification reasons, but the desire for relationships in which they can definitively be a dominating party, and the relative vulnerability possessed by a majority of humans is the attractive quality.<br /> <br /> Probably often an intersection of all three.<br /> <br /> Last is the question of whether non-humans actually did have noteworthy similar relationships. As far as I know, there's never been a definitive statement on the subject and it doesn't exactly have a lot of prominence owing to the scarcity of those beings in the first place, but I have to suspect that the original Exalted would have been averse owing to White Wolf still kind of reeling from the absurdity of Samuel Haight. As far as I know, that was all long before I ever had a connection to any of this. But I do know that people have often expressed a... semi-canon sentiment of &quot;pre-existing supernatural powers render you incompatible with parentage that lends further supernatural powers&quot;.<br /> <br /> My perspective is that everything has grown far past that. If somebody wants to propose that Kimbery ever mated with a Dragon King to produce some kind of Lintha dinosaur person with a combination of the powers of both, I say go for it. Hell, throw a spirit in there as well, make them a Dragon Sea King ochilike.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-22T10:17:16-08:00","id":1362672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1361102-don-t-f-k-the-gay-f-k-cthulhu?p=1362603#post1362603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <di